<title>UK: BP takes Oct 8-10 Brent date.</title>
<headline>BP takes Oct 8-10 Brent date.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>BP took the sole Brent date which turned wet on Monday, taking the total number of Brent cargoes held by the oil major to nine, traders said.</p>
<p>They said BP kept the Oct8-10 cargo ahead of the five o'clock deadline.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
</text>
